---
description: Architecture and invariant docs must stay consistent with tests and AGENTS.md
globs: ["docs/**/*.md", "AGENTS.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing architecture or invariant docs:

- Keep invariant IDs stable. Do not renumber `INV-001`–`INV-016`.
- If behavior of an invariant changes, update `tests/architecture/` in the same change.
- Do not conflate the **coding harness** with the **AnomalyOS runtime harness**.
- Record durable choices in `docs/DECISIONS.md`, not only in chat.
- Do not paste the full `AGENTS.md` contract into other docs; link it.
